      "id": 493745,
      "username": "aei-gt",
      "name": "Alquimia E Integra",
      "created_at": "2026-02-09T07:15:02.885Z",
      "cooked": "<p>review again all but not working, one step more i create a full new app in v16 to verify but not work again. No option to disable “custom”.</p>\n<p>Solution (not the easy way): Create from console the doctype and force to = 0 the custon field.</p>\n<p>doc = frappe.get_doc({ “doctype”: “DocType”, “name”: doctype, “module”: module, “custom”: 0, “autoname”: “hash”, “fields”: [ {“fieldname”: “title”, “label”: “Title”, “fieldtype”: “Data”} ], “permissions”: [ {“role”: “System Manager”, “read”: 1, “write”: 1, “create”: 1, “delete”: 1} ] }).insert(ignore_permissions=True)</p>\n<p>but of course is not a easy way because need create by code every doctype. I think is a limitation/feature/bug in V16. In v15 no problem.</p>",
